===Etymology===
From {{af|en|air|sickness}} or {{af|en|airsick|-ness}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|es}}

# A feeling of [[nausea]], [[dizziness]] etc. caused by the motion of an [[aircraft]]; a form of [[motion sickness]].

